From 1fdc03043318541f835dc6d2fda70f3f40cc8195 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@aol.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:07:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 73/75] winemac.drv: A movable frame for a virtual desktop, and
 Windows function keys.

As on the arm64 build: a titled frame for a virtual desktop whose
position the screen-coordinate conversions add (metalsharp/MetalSharp#805;
WINEMAC_DESKTOP_FRAME=0 turns it off), and WINEMAC_FKEYS=windows for F1-F12
while the program is active, the keyboard's own setting put back on
deactivation and exit (metalsharp/MetalSharp#802).
